{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n.titleBox{\r\n\tmax-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 12px;color:#333;\r\n\tfont-family:'Heebo','Pretendard',sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n.sectionTitleH2{\r\n\tmargin:18px 0 8px;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:5.2rem;\r\n\tfont-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#222;\r\n}\r\n.font-28{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:18px;}\r\n\r\n.block{max-width:645px;padding:20px 0;}\r\n\r\n.option{\r\n\tmargin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #666;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;\r\n}\r\n.option h6,.textBox h6{\r\n\tfont-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 14px;color:#222;\r\n}\r\n.option dl{\r\n\tdisplay:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0;\r\n}\r\n.option dl:first-of-type{border-top:0;}\r\n.option dt{width:160px;font-weight:700;}\r\n.option dd{margin:0;color:#555;}\r\n\r\n.textBox p{font-size:15px;color:#555;margin-bottom:16px;}\r\n.sizeBox{\r\n\tmargin-top:28px;\r\n\tpadding:26px 18px;\r\n\tbackground:#f7f7f7;\r\n\tborder-radius:8px;\r\n\ttext-align:center;\r\n}\r\n.sizeTitle{\r\n\tfont-size:18px;\r\n\tfont-weight:800;\r\n\tmargin-bottom:14px;\r\n}\r\n.sizeList{\r\n\tdisplay:flex;\r\n\tjustify-content:center;\r\n\tflex-wrap:wrap;\r\n\tgap:12px;\r\n}\r\n.sizeItem{\r\n\tpadding:10px 18px;\r\n\tbackground:#222;\r\n\tcolor:#fff;\r\n\tfont-weight:700;\r\n\tborder-radius:4px;\r\n\tfont-size:15px;\r\n\tletter-spacing:0.5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:600px){\r\n.sectionTitleH2{font-size:2.8rem;}\r\n.option dl{flex-direction:column;}\r\n.option dt{width:auto;}\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"titleBox\">\r\n\r\n<h2 class=\"sectionTitleH2\">3단 볼레일</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"font-28\">3-Fold Ball Bearing Drawer Slide</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sizeBox\">\r\n<div class=\"sizeTitle\">✔ 선택 가능 사이즈 (총 4종)</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sizeList\">\r\n<div class=\"sizeItem\">300mm</div>\r\n<div class=\"sizeItem\">350mm</div>\r\n<div class=\"sizeItem\">400mm</div>\r\n<div class=\"sizeItem\">450mm</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"option block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 사양</h6>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>제품특성</dt>\r\n<dd>3단 35폭 날개형 볼레일</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>최대하중</dt>\r\n<dd>35kg</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>재질</dt>\r\n<dd>스틸(Steel)</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>마감 / 색상</dt>\r\n<dd>아연도금 / 실버(Silver)</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>재료규격(외/중/내)</dt>\r\n<dd>1.0 × 1.0 × 1.0 mm</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n<dl>\r\n<dt>내구성</dt>\r\n<dd>내구성 40,000회 / 염수분무 36시간 통과</dd>\r\n</dl>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"textBox block\">\r\n\r\n<h6>상품 설명</h6>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n3단 볼레일은 완전 인출형 구조로 제작된 서랍 전용 슬라이드 레일입니다.\r\n볼베어링 구조로 부드러운 개폐와 안정적인 하중 지지를 제공하며,\r\n가정용 가구, 싱크대, 붙박이장, 사무용 가구 등에 폭넓게 사용됩니다.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h6>특이사항</h6>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n• 완전 인출형 구조로 서랍 내부까지 100% 사용 가능<br />\r\n• 최대 하중 35kg 설계로 안정적인 수납 성능<br />\r\n• 아연도금 처리로 녹 발생 최소화<br />\r\n• 40,000회 내구 테스트 통과 제품\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}